{"contract":"translation_contextual_v2","candidate_identity":"b38072910a9be39bd3478d213568afecbc48165e04112596ff4101679dd39f78","verdicts":[{"revision_key":"3572191ce781a3350a25c96c27b4e1a6412a0a4cf30febb15bb511f6087037c1","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"ed3323c63dfed63f370909ea024a1022f153f8df4e3e33f659344c162c01143d","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"ed41bdd6580f76a4f035d83daf2c50dfa58c2bf80bc92d9b447422de134cb71f","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"ed521ffd82554fccb2e56865baaf9c4f480adf6bd23d4ff0403b6793f5430796","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"ed8673e41a7d04e69012aca27620bd886c1712ff3aec6ece4efab8e8f801ead1","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"warrior.lua:343 源文列举三类人：pit-fighter（地下格斗场斗士）、boxer（拳击手）、amateur practitioner（业余习武者）。译文只剩两类，'无论是一个职业拳手还是个业余的门外汉'漏掉了 pit-fighter；'门外汉'意为外行，和 practitioner（实际练习者）意思相反。另外'Brawler's skills'（格斗家职业的技能）被泛化成了'格斗技能'。"},{"revision_key":"ed86ff05a4f099244e7dfde68a8a2d2c325860305f6b0ab71656467cf4330fbb","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"town-point-zero/npcs.lua:134 Zemekkys 的描述是'A timeless elf... his age is impossible to determine'，即看不出年纪。译文加了源文没有的'中年'，给出一个确定年龄段，和下一句'不知道他活了多久'自相矛盾。'timeless'应译为'不显年岁'之类。"},{"revision_key":"edc13e8a271135c9fa780dcbb8b4b0b4e549aae2e3223c5bc005fe14bf0ceffe","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"edc38802167d4a34ace1a868ce8c60a468d1b23f03dd0b2845311ed6d2b38e3d","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"edc794ff9790e88861a4368d236f7fb2c49abe4a7ae8e706d3ed071218d6af4a","verdict":"OK"}]}